OL,3,GNEWSA'I thought my drinking habits were
OL,4,Anormal'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor years, Celine Le Luyer thought her
OL,7,Fdrinking habits were normal.
OL,9,FHer twenties included weekends which
OL,10,Frevolved around pubs, nights out and
OL,11,Flarge amounts of alcohol.
OL,13,FBut what started as social drinking
OL,14,Fgradually became something she relied
OL,15,Fon to cope with anxiety, stress and
OL,16,Fdeclining mental health.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
